J = FR + 'On the CROWN name join of record (R857-4; units = wave-6a\'s crown61 list, 61 = 54 subjects + 7 fields: avl 8+2, bst 5+2, buffer 28, ht 2, quadtree 11+3; joined by name to the frame census and through the frame\'s slot index, agents/artifacts/2026-10-06-analysis-fanout-076/keymap). '
